      skos:broader narr:KPIsSuccess ;
      skos:note "The Zephyr integration acted as a force-multiplier that enabled the team to ship the async decision widget and achieve 23 points — the highest velocity this quarter. The pattern: a targeted integration unlock → delivery acceleration → measurable velocity record." ;
